Package: ssh3-server
Version: 0.1.1-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ssh3-c maintainers <maintainers@example.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6, zlib1g, libzstd1, adduser
Description: SSH3 server - SSH over QUIC/HTTP3 transport
 SSH3 server daemon: the SSH3 protocol carried over HTTP/3 (QUIC),
 implemented in C in the nginx style on top of the OpenSSL QUIC TLS API.
 .
 OpenSSL 3.5 ships inside the package: the unmodified Debian 13 shared
 libraries (libssl.so.3, libcrypto.so.3) live in the private
 /usr/lib/ssh3-c/lib/ and the binary RUNPATH pins them there, so the
 system libssl (any version) is neither required nor touched.
 .
 The daemon is configured through environment variables (SSH3_LOG_LEVEL,
 SSH3_LOG_FILE, SSH3_SHUTDOWN_DRAIN) and command-line flags (ssh3-server -h);
 it drops privileges to the system user "ssh3" and keeps its state under
 /var/lib/ssh3.
